		<label>Divine Diurganate</label>
		<description>The Twin-Tailed Kingdom — also known as Divine Diurganate — is a theocratic ratkin kingdom founded by followers of the Holy Twin-Tail. While the nation has industrialized, its social structure remains largely religious, resulting in a landscape of billowing diesel mechs, spark-splattering factories, and ubiquitous shrines and icons. \n\nCompared to other industrialized ratkin kingdoms, the Divine Diurganate is far ahead. The Catholic Church has spearheaded the development of a series of large-scale equipment, mechs, and aircraft powered by diesel and internal combustion engines, establishing a technological advantage over other ratkin kingdoms. Due to religious fanaticism, the ratkins of this kingdom are not as peaceful and docile as their counterparts. They possess a tradition of extreme xenophobia and hostility towards other races and are obsessed with outward expansion and the assimilation of other ratkins.</description>
		<colorSpectrum>
			<li>(0.6, 0.2, 0.2)</li>
			<li>(0.6, 0.2, 0.2)</li>
		</colorSpectrum>
